StrategyIQ — Bloomberg Terminal replica for retail.

Rules:
- Always include SEC disclaimer: "Financial information only, not financial advice"
- Never scrape — use Polygon.io, CoinGecko Pro, FMP, Finnhub APIs with env keys
- Tier gating via Depends(get_user_tier) checking subscription.active
- EQS: routers/screener.py with 50 filters, cache 15min in Redis
- PORT: PortGo.tsx — Sharpe = sqrt(252)*mean/std, VaR = 5th percentile, Monte Carlo
- Grok: route breaking/trending to integrations/grok.py
- All DB changes via Alembic: alembic revision --autogenerate
- Deploy: docker-compose up locally, deploy-aws.sh for ECS
- CI/CD: .github/workflows/deploy.yml — Vercel frontend + AWS ECS backend on push to main

Tiers:
- Beginner (free): 3 queries/day, delayed data
- Pro ($29): real-time + signals
- Elite ($79): custom agents + PORT analytics
